For the purposes of this Order, an employer shall make any adjustment in respect of an employee’s contract of service within the transitional period of 6 months starting from 12th July 2023. 8 CAP. 278, O 1 Employment

SCHEDULE 1 (paragraph 2(1))

APPLICATION OF ORDER All employees who are under a contract of service for employment with the following —

(a) a bank licensed under section 4 or 23 of the Banking Order, 2006 (S 45/2006) and an Islamic bank licensed under section 4 or 23 of the Islamic Banking Order, 2008 (S 96/2008);

(b) a finance company licensed under the Finance Companies Act (Chapter 89);

(c) a telecommunication system or service operator licensed under section 5 of the Telecommunications Order, 2001 (S 38/2001);

(d) Bank Usahawan Berhad;

(e) the Perbadanan Tabung Amanah Islam Brunei established by section 3(1) of the Perbadanan Tabung Amanah Islam Brunei Act (Chapter 163).

